                <pb facs="0355" n="271" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg271"/>

                <head>No. 121.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Beach to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guayaquil</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-08-11"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 11, 1885</date>.
                        (Received August 11.)</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">Secretary <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bayard</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Information positive that Santos liberated.</p>
                <closer><signed>BEACH.</signed></closer>
            </div>
